From: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dt-bindings: cache: describe SM7675 LLCC regions

SM7675 Cliffs7 exposes four banks followed by the broadcast window.
Describe these as native resources instead of the OEM aggregate range.

Source: MiCode/kernel_devicetree uke-v-oss
94c84aeb9e517dbde546fc732033c184094c8e57, qcom/cliffs{,7}.dtsi.
This binding does not activate a board or establish hardware acceptance.

Signed-off-by: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cache/qcom,llcc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/cache/qcom,llcc.yaml
@@ -40,6 +40,7 @@
           - qcom,shikra-llcc
           - qcom,sm6350-llcc
           - qcom,sm7150-llcc
+          - qcom,sm7675-llcc
           - qcom,sm8150-llcc
           - qcom,sm8250-llcc
           - qcom,sm8350-llcc
@@ -304,6 +305,7 @@
               - qcom,sm8150-llcc
               - qcom,sm8250-llcc
               - qcom,sm8350-llcc
+              - qcom,sm7675-llcc
     then:
       properties:
         reg:
